          "detail": "verbatim capture → expansion → unanimous-drop judgment"
        },
        {
          "id": "route:R24",
          "kind": "route",
          "label": "R24 Model training (keyword_program::train_if_data_grew → pipeline 17 TrainModel)",
          "detail": "dataset → train → held-out sign test → registry; models are graph citizens"
        },
        {
          "id": "route:R25",
          "kind": "route",
          "label": "R25 Ranked search (StoreAccess::search_ranked → SearchContainersByKeywords{strategy:\"token\"} → keyword_program::order_for_search)",
          "detail": "span-out, context_aggregation, text/code/math linking; interchangeability knobs OZONE_KEYWORD_BACKENDS, OZONE_SEARCH_DEFAULT"
        },
        {
          "id": "route:R26",
          "kind": "route",
          "label": "R26 Origin propagation (keyword_program::Origin; orchestrate() installs it with the trace, traced() carries it across spawns, loops install Origin::actor, executor.rs stamps OZONE_ORIGIN, 33+1 pipelines send x-ozone-trace / x-ozone-origin, grpc::query_zsei re-installs both)",
          "detail": "every created, search and outcome event carries call_site / workspace / project / global / request terms / file ids; a pipeline-originated search joins the walk's trace"
        },
        {
          "id": "route:R27",
          "kind": "route",
          "label": "R27 Creation + lifecycle capture (zsei/query.rs::create_container → record_created; update_container → record_keywords_changed)",
          "detail": "the ONE write door logs created (type, name, keywords, topics, typed scope, parent, provenance, origin) and keywords_changed (added / removed) for every writer; dataset builder turns a methodology/blueprint created event with request terms into a CREATION PAIR"
        },
        {
          "id": "route:R28",
          "kind": "route",
          "label": "R28 Write-time keyword gate (zsei/query.rs::create_container / update_container → keyword_program::gate_keywords_on_write)",
          "detail": "shape rules (empty / sentence-like / case-duplicate never enter) + every new term registered PENDING (created:<call_site>); JurisdictionRuleSet and bookkeeping types are NOT gated (their keywords are routing keys / system tags)"
        },
        {
          "id": "route:R29",
          "kind": "route",
          "label": "R29 Keyword validation (keyword_loops settlement actor → keyword_settle::settle_once → validate_terms)",
          "detail": "validates stored terms and new expansion candidates; kill switch OZONE_KEYWORD_SETTLE=off; strict search OZONE_KEYWORD_REQUIRE_VALIDATED, ablation OZONE_KEYWORD_IGNORE_EXPANSION (both default off)"
        },
        {
          "id": "route:R30",
          "kind": "route",
          "label": "R30 Rule gate (after the blueprint draft, before audit_rule_refs → judge_rule_applicability (applicability + step→rule fidelity in ONE call, 2026-11-10 moved); rule text via rules_text_for at the four post-AMT prompt sites)",
          "detail": "replaces the end-of-Stage-6 E14; verdicts in state.rule_verdicts + provider manifest rows"
        },
        {
          "id": "route:R31",
          "kind": "route",
          "label": "R31 Refinement notification (stages::judge_rule_applicability → meta_loop::record_refinement_candidate)",
          "detail": "durable methodology_refinement_candidates.jsonl: every rule judged inapplicable = a methodology that is too broad (refinement loop input; never a new/modify gap)"
        },
        {
          "id": "route:R32",
          "kind": "route",
          "label": "R32 Marketplace publish / pull / fetch / import (bridge (drains every creation event already available) → network::on_items_announced → publish_batch_to_marketplace (ONE listing write, ONE push per batch); network::spawn_marketplace_exchange; orchestrator::peer_import::spawn_peer_import_loop; POST /marketplace/offers/decide)",
          "detail": "notify (one push, names nothing) → pull listing → operator decides → fetch in chunks → re-verify hash → import a methodology through the create path / stage a jurisdiction file / record approval for tools; all opt-in via auto_broadcast_sync"
        },
        {
          "id": "route:R33",
          "kind": "route",
          "label": "R33 The network door + offer review (network swarm handler → sanitize_marketplace_message → peer_marketplace_inbox.jsonl / peer_marketplace_rejected.jsonl; offer_review::spawn_offer_review_loop → peer_offer_reviews.json; both exposed by GET /marketplace/overview as peer_offers[].review, exchange.refused_inbound)",
          "detail": "nothing not allowed is accepted: only methodology / jurisdiction_rule_set / pipeline / tool, strict shapes, scope markers stripped from peers' keywords, unknown fields dropped; the review only RECOMMENDS"
        },
        {
          "id": "route:R34",
          "kind": "route",
          "label": "R34 Work-order tree (work_order::materialize_work_order after task creation in stage_6_to_8_execute_steps; work_order_step_done on both step-success paths; work_order_after_replan; work_order_walk_done; GET /order/work/<task_id>)",
          "detail": "the walk's structure as wo_* task records (AMT branches, steps, capability-gap checklists); completion = all items done + all children complete, completed is final; items ticked only by the real events (STATUS §K1); PARSE-ONLY"
        },
        {
          "id": "route:R35",
          "kind": "route",
          "label": "R35 Refinement action (meta_loop::act_on_refinement_candidates, pass step 1d)",
          "detail": "splits a rule that is a different concern into a focused methodology via pipeline 12 Create; records methodology_refinement_actions.jsonl; never edits the original; kill switch OZONE_REFINEMENT_ACTION=off; PARSE-ONLY"
        },
        {
          "id": "route:R36",
          "kind": "route",
          "label": "R36 Read endpoints for the UI (2026-11-10, no model, no write): GET /capability/gaps (every row of capability_gaps.json, any status; count, by_status), GET /methodology/refinement (methodology_refinement_report.json or {}, the parsed lines of methodology_refinement_actions.jsonl read live, and the candidate-line count), /task/list + /task/get now carry kind, parent_task_id, rerun_of",
          "detail": "read-only views of ledgers the walk / meta loop already write; nothing derived or scored; grpc/mod.rs (get_capability_gaps, get_methodology_refinement, TaskInfo) — EDITED, PARSE-ONLY"
        },
        {
          "id": "route:R37",
          "kind": "route",
          "label": "R37 Tool creation on need (stages::close_capability_gaps → create_tool_for_capability → tool_creation::{parse_spec, write_artifact} → mcp::register_global → tool_binding::mark_gap_tool_created → network::publish_created_tool → bridge on_items_announced)",
          "detail": "creates <data_dir>/created_tools/<name>/ + a stdio registry row (nothing executed by the host); gap → satisfied with provenance; work-order tool/register ticked by tool_created/tool_registered; the finding is published as a manifest (name + body hash + keywords, item_type tool) while marketplace_publish is on. PARSE-ONLY"
        }
